@host = http://localhost:5116

### 1. Create → 201
POST {{host}}/motos
Content-Type: application/json

{ "identificador": "moto123", "ano": 2020, "modelo": "Sport", "placa": "ABC-1234" }

### 2. Duplicate plate → 400 {"mensagem":"Dados inválidos"}
POST {{host}}/motos
Content-Type: application/json

{ "identificador": "moto456", "ano": 2021, "modelo": "Sport", "placa": "ABC-1234" }

### 3. Duplicate id → 400
POST {{host}}/motos
Content-Type: application/json

{ "identificador": "moto123", "ano": 2021, "modelo": "Sport", "placa": "DEF-5678" }

### 4. List all → 200 [ ... ]
GET {{host}}/motos

### 5. Filter by plate → 200 with 1 item
GET {{host}}/motos?placa=ABC-1234

### 6. Not found → 404 {"mensagem":"Moto não encontrada"}
GET {{host}}/motos/does-not-exist

### 7. Change plate → 200 {"mensagem":"Placa modificada com sucesso"}
PUT {{host}}/motos/moto123/placa
Content-Type: application/json

{ "placa": "XYZ-9999" }

### 8. Empty body → 400 {"mensagem":"Dados inválidos"}
POST {{host}}/motos
Content-Type: application/json

{ }

### 9. Delete → 200 (then re-run #6 with moto123 → 404)
DELETE {{host}}/motos/moto123